{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Establish UK- wide standards for accessible & ready-to-use public defibrillators",
        "additional_details": "The framework should:\r\n\r\nSet minimum standards for AED access and readiness, inc signage.\r\nEnsure AEDs are registered on The Circuit and locatable by ambulance services.\r\nConsistent standards for placement.\r\nImprove integration with ambulance services.\r\nCollect data on AED location, access, readiness Etc.\r\nSet rules for maintenance, governance readiness.\r\nAddress geographical and socioeconomic inequalities in AED access.\r\nPromote UK-wide standards and best practice.",
        "background": "We want the UK Government to work with the devolved administrations and relevant organisations to establish consistent UK-wide standards ensuring public AEDs are accessible, registered, maintained and ready when needed.",
